Default app icons (app/src/main/res/drawable):

mudita_clock: the clock glyph (ic_clock_time) of Mudita's Kompakt Phone app (Mudita), unchanged.

mudita_folder: the folder glyph (ic_folder) of Mudita's Kompakt Music player app (Mudita), unchanged.

delta_chat: the speech bubble from the icon of Mudita's Kompakt Messages app (Mudita), with the
delta letter from Delta Chat's logo (https://github.com/deltachat/deltachat-pages,
assets/logos/delta-chat.svg, GNU General Public License v3.0) in place of the dots.

The other default icons (calendar, radio, gallery, search, settings, sim, chromium) are Katapult's
bundled drawables; googlechrome is from the Simple Icons catalogue (see docs/ICON_CATALOGUE.md).

Built-in wallpaper (app/src/main/res/drawable-nodpi/kotatsu_wallpaper.png):
Kotatsu's own artwork, created by Alex Indigo using ComfyUI and contributed for distribution with Kotatsu.
